The AAR published by this project bundles FFmpeg libraries (libavcodec,
libavutil and libswresample) linked into libffmpegJNI. FFmpeg is Copyright (c)
2000-2026 the FFmpeg developers and is licensed under the GNU Lesser General
Public License, version 2.1 or later. FFmpeg is built without --enable-gpl,
--enable-nonfree and --enable-version3.

Source and build instructions for FFmpeg in a released AAR:

- Every release publishes the corresponding source next to the AAR on Maven
  Central, signed like the AAR. It has the classifier ffmpeg-source:
  https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/io/put/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/<version>/media3-ffmpeg-decoder-<version>-ffmpeg-source.tar.xz
- That archive holds the FFmpeg source at the pinned commit, the JNI wrapper
  that links it, the build scripts, and BUILD.txt with the rebuild command.
- Every AAR carries META-INF/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/ffmpeg-build.txt with the
  exact FFmpeg commit, build script and per-ABI configure lines, and the LGPL
  text in META-INF/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/COPYING.LGPLv2.1.

